"                                                                                "
"  Jobs  3 jobs ╭ Jobs keys ─────────────────────────────────────╮               "
"               │↑↓       move                                   │               "
"    Several job│g  G     first, last                            │               "
"               │enter    run the job, or several                │               "
"  ➤ documents  │p        run some of its destinations           │               "
"        → work:│a        add a job                              │               "
"        → /Volu│e        edit the job                           │               "
"    photos     │d        remove the job (asks first)            │               "
"        → perso│j  k     move the job down or up the list       │               "
"    notes      │/        filter by name, folder or destination  │               "
"        → work:│?        show or hide these keys                │go · 2 held    "
"               │esc      clear the filter, or go back           │               "
"               │q        go back                                │               "
"               │ctrl-c   quit OneFolder                         │               "
"               │                                                │               "
"               │any key closes this                             │               "
"               ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────╯               "
"  enter run · p partial · a add · e edit · d remove · ? keys · q back           "
"                                                                                "
